# TinyAssets daemon + worker request-admission secret.
#
# Install as /etc/tinyassets/request-idempotency.env with owner
# root:tinyassets and mode 640. Do not inject it into tunnel/logging sidecars.
# Generate canonical base64 for 48 random bytes and never reuse the
# daemon-only agent-interchange key. Once admitted records exist, this key is
# immutable until versioned dual-read rotation support ships.
TINYASSETS_REQUEST_IDEMPOTENCY_HMAC_KEY=
